967} :answer-field/id #uuid "2ed3d2d8-4f1c-594f-a23f-9c182a9b15fd" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387966}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "0de4893d-7cb9-56f5-b35a-b2fd344e566c" :question/math-academy-id "q-316996" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}3x+2y-z=1 \\\\ y-3z=0 \\\\ 4z=12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $3$ | $2$ | $-1$ |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | $1$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | {{field-1}} | $1$ | {{field-2}} |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | $0$ |  | . |\n|  |  | $0$ | {{field-3}} | $4$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | {{field-4}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}3x+2y-z=1 \\\\ 0x+y-3z=0 \\\\ 0x+0y+4z=12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 12\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 12\\end{aligned}].\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186387968 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Entries of a Matrix Product Representing a 3x3 System of Equations by Reorganizing"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4fb8022d-f88c-51d5-bdbb-02139e04049f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387970}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4fb8022d-f88c-51d5-bdbb-02139e04049f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387970} :answer-field/id #uuid "425dc2c3-ac67-52cd-94e9-006ef29400bf" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387969} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f79e892-a39c-53e8-89b9-1a786484e44c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387972}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0f79e892-a39c-53e8-89b9-1a786484e44c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387972} :answer-field/id #uuid "7ba4bf4a-abd6-5f9e-9b8c-d2d0adde7a4d" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387971} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a94be3ec-0893-502c-855e-dbecb3a13a6a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387974}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a94be3ec-0893-502c-855e-dbecb3a13a6a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387974} :answer-field/id #uuid "a76be019-3002-5803-a0ba-147a3acf5645" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387973} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1d978891-564c-5107-9349-6571c3edd373" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387976}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1d978891-564c-5107-9349-6571c3edd373" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387976} :answer-field/id #uuid "59d717c2-f709-5179-ad12-6570299f3038" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387975}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "7597efd4-3b81-5689-8f46-641b09df6c89" :question/math-academy-id "q-316998" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2z-2y-5x=5 \\\\ -3z+3y+4x=1 \\\\ 2z-2x+y=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $-5$ | {{field-1}} | $2$ |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | $5$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $4$ | $3$ | {{field-2}} |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | {{field-3}} |  | . |\n|  |  | $-2$ | {{field-4}} | $2$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | $2$ |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-5x-2y+2z=5 \\\\ 4x+3y-3z=1 \\\\ -2x+y+2z=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-5 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 3 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-5 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 3 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186387977 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Entries of a Matrix Product Representing a 3x3 System of Equations by Reorganizing"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "41e238cb-f29e-57d0-8f3e-d2f4c23ec496" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387979}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "41e238cb-f29e-57d0-8f3e-d2f4c23ec496" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387979} :answer-field/id #uuid "44e67f2e-05e5-546d-b9f3-b00d09404ed5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387978} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d6712f2b-9f76-5866-a29b-5ecfb25f4fd3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387981}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d6712f2b-9f76-5866-a29b-5ecfb25f4fd3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387981} :answer-field/id #uuid "8c514bcc-c4f8-50db-8205-47b1488a212c" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387980} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "91f69603-c19d-55f9-bf41-9772335b0388" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387983}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "91f69603-c19d-55f9-bf41-9772335b0388" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387983} :answer-field/id #uuid "5cdf3b0d-cbb4-50b0-bd5c-4de2c6bd9187" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387982} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9a78dbe9-fa60-538c-b28a-34c6f0a9252a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387985}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9a78dbe9-fa60-538c-b28a-34c6f0a9252a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387985} :answer-field/id #uuid "1ed400a0-0d97-56a8-b30f-2c3c810f7c1b" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387984}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "b2eb1f65-7297-5a4d-ba62-8b921fc0f9d9" :question/math-academy-id "q-317639" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}4z+x-3=7 \\\\ 2x-5y+6=1 \\\\ 3y+7z-4x+5=10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $1$ | $0$ | {{field-1}} |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | $10$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $2$ | {{field-2}} | $0$ |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | {{field-3}} |  | . |\n|  |  | {{field-4}} | $3$ | $7$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | $5$ |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x+0y+4z=10 \\\\ 2x-5y+0z=-5 \\\\ -4x+3y+7z=5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 3 & 7\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 3 & 7\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}].\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186387986 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1938c5da-d01a-53b7-a811-9afe1e43d152" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Entries of a Matrix Product Representing a 3x3 System of Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4e552ae7-7bc1-5865-9d1b-324da8707b72" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-4,\\,b=0,\\,c=4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387988} {:answer/id #uuid "a0356dda-e531-5623-b8d9-80e07685872c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-2,\\,b=7,\\,c=-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387989} {:answer/id #uuid "227c079f-4f66-5d1a-b6b1-f92e10a96aee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=8,\\,b=-5,\\,c=-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387990} {:answer/id #uuid "f44fe60c-2ef1-503f-8a23-4dd970502654" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-4,\\,b=-5,\\,c=8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387991} {:answer/id #uuid "b30cace5-a6a3-5cfc-b4ca-eabf2565610a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=3,\\,b=4,\\,c=7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387992}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "227c079f-4f66-5d1a-b6b1-f92e10a96aee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=8,\\,b=-5,\\,c=-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387990} :answer-field/id #uuid "6ca0e6c5-dbee-5cec-b15c-a80819a6b68e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387987}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "7453f1a6-06ff-5426-872e-583972ef69f7" :question/math-academy-id "q-36178" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}3x+2y+8z=0 \\\\ 2x-5y+4z=3 \\\\ 5x-4y+7z=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & a \\\\ 2 & b & 4 \\\\ 5 & c & 7\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "We can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 8 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 4 \\\\ 5 & -4 & 7\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 8 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 4 \\\\ 5 & -4 & 7\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=8,\\,b=-5,\\,c=-4.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186330367 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Entries of a Matrix Product Representing a 3x3 System of Equations by Reorganizing"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "614d19c8-9998-5a5e-b557-ba50f566abcd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-2,\\,b=-1,\\,c=-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186330369} {:answer/id #uuid "18f9f8f7-0fbb-50f8-8960-e3feefaeaf20" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-2,\\,b=-4,\\,c=-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186330370} {:answer/id #uuid "1edcddf3-971a-5fa8-a22d-9e57a1a2245f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=5,\\,b=4,\\,c=-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186330371} {:answer/id #uuid "49414cb7-7641-5475-8b14-0104ac5e4734" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-5,\\,b=-4,\\,c=-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186330372} {:answer/id #uuid "88ba2c9a-e82c-503e-9b2c-eac9f24df940" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-5,\\,b=-1,\\,c=-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186330373}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "18f9f8f7-0fbb-50f8-8960-e3feefaeaf20" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-2,\\,b=-4,\\,c=-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186330370} :answer-field/id #uuid "af2b5a8d-a99b-594c-a3fb-95853ef62c2f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186330368}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "9a147cf2-1edd-5a7f-9f80-a95a1f3975b9" :question/math-academy-id "q-75512" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-2z+x-5y=1 \\\\ -y+5z-4x=-2 \\\\ 2x-6y-z=2\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 & a \\\\ b & -1 & 5 \\\\ 2 & c & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x-5y-2z=1 \\\\ -4x-y+5z=-2 \\\\ 2x-6y-z=2\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 & -2 \\\\ -4 & -1 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -6 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 & -2 \\\\ -4 & -1 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -6 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=-2,\\,b=-4,\\,c=-6.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186387993 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Entries of a Matrix Product Representing a 3x3 System of Equations by Reorganizing"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6316cd7a-b7ca-5257-9772-c93e04ee0bbd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=2,\\,b=0,\\,c=-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387995} {:answer/id #uuid "a12b088f-6702-50c5-913d-d07c9d0b86ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=2,\\,b=2,\\,c=-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387996} {:answer/id #uuid "2a267c76-7132-5236-8435-cae7b7130bb3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=2,\\,b=1,\\,c=-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387997} {:answer/id #uuid "82af9219-a8e9-5cea-9940-f524459bde79" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-5,\\,b=0,\\,c=-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387998} {:answer/id #uuid "87fd2364-748f-5168-81dd-d54c680896ef" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-5,\\,b=-1,\\,c=-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387999}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2a267c76-7132-5236-8435-cae7b7130bb3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=2,\\,b=1,\\,c=-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387997} :answer-field/id #uuid "76a9c91d-c0e8-553a-ae3f-a93815fbc272" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387994}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "cfc39e76-47ed-504b-8526-73e06adc538f" :question/math-academy-id "q-75513" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}z-5x+2y=0 \\\\ z=1-2x \\\\ 7y-3x-2z=0\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-5 & a & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 7 & c\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ b \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-5x+2y+z=0 \\\\ 2x+0y+z=1 \\\\ -3x+7y-2z=0\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 7 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 7 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=2,\\,b=1,\\,c=-2.$"}]}
